<title>USA: American Physicians to buy back shares.</title>
<headline>American Physicians to buy back shares.</headline>
<dateline>AUSTIN, Texas 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>American Physicians Service Group Inc said Friday its board has authorized the purchase of up to 500,000 shares of its common stock.</p>
<p>The company said it has repurchased more than 2.7 million of its shares since 1986, including 65,000 shares this year. It said it now has about 4.05 million shares outstanding.</p>
<p>American Physician shares were up 7/16 Friday at 6-7/8.</p>
</text>
